file" aria-label="Oluwapelumi Adejumo profile"> <noscript><img alt='Oluwapelumi Adejumo' src='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-oluwapelumi-adejumo-150x150.jpg' srcset='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-oluwapelumi-adejumo-300x300.jpg 2x' class='avatar avatar-96 photo editorial-credits__avatar-image' height='96' width='96' decoding='async'/></noscript><img alt='Oluwapelumi Adejumo' src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox=%220%200%2096%2096%22%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-oluwapelumi-adejumo-150x150.jpg' data-srcset='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-oluwapelumi-adejumo-300x300.jpg 2x' class='lazyload avatar avatar-96 photo editorial-credits__avatar-image' height='96' width='96' decoding='async'/> </a><div class="editorial-credits__content editorial-credits__content--author"> <a class="post-meta-card__name editorial-credits__name" href="https://cryptoslate.com/author/oluwapelumi-adejumo/" title="Oluwapelumi Adejumo profile"> Oluwapelumi Adejumo </a><div class="post-meta-card__title editorial-credits__title"> <span>Senior Reporter</span> <span class="title-separator" aria-hidden="true">•</span> <span>CryptoSlate</span></div><p class="post-meta-card__bio editorial-credits__bio">Oluwapelumi values Bitcoin's potential. He imparts insights on a range of topics like DeFi, hacks, mining and culture, underlining transformative power.</p><div class="editorial-credits__actions"><div class="post-meta-card__social editorial-credits__social"> <a rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" href="https://x.com/hardeyjumoh" class="social-chip x" title="Oluwapelumi Adejumo on X" aria-label="Oluwapelumi Adejumo on X"> <span class="chip__label">X</span> </a> <a rel="nofollow noopener" target="_blank" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/oluwapelumi-adejumo" class="social-chip linkedin" title="Oluwapelumi Adejumo on LinkedIn" aria-label="Oluwapelumi Adejumo on LinkedIn"> <span class="chip__label">LinkedIn</span> </a></div> <a class="post-meta-card__profile editorial-credits__profile" href="https://cryptoslate.com/author/oluwapelumi-adejumo/" title="Oluwapelumi Adejumo profile"> <i class="fa-light fa-user" aria-hidden="true"></i> <span>View profile</span> <i class="fa-light fa-arrow-right" aria-hidden="true"></i> </a></div></div></div> <span class="editorial-credits__divider" aria-hidden="true"></span><div class="post-meta-single footer editorial editor post-meta-card editorial-credits__editor"> <a class="editorial-credits__avatar editorial-credits__avatar--editor" href="https://cryptoslate.com/author/andjela-radmilac/" title="Andjela Radmilac profile" aria-label="Andjela Radmilac profile"> <noscript><img alt='Andjela Radmilac' src='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-andjela-radmilac-150x150.jpg' srcset='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-andjela-radmilac-150x150.jpg 2x' class='avatar avatar-64 photo editorial-credits__avatar-image' height='64' width='64' decoding='async'/></noscript><img alt='Andjela Radmilac' src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox=%220%200%2064%2064%22%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-andjela-radmilac-150x150.jpg' data-srcset='https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2025/12/profile-photo-andjela-radmilac-150x150.jpg 2x' class='lazyload avatar avatar-64 photo editorial-credits__avatar-image' height='64' width='64' decoding='async'/> </a><div class="editorial-credits__content editorial-credits__content--editor"> <a class="post-meta-card__name editorial-credits__name" href="https://cryptoslate.com/author/andjela-radmilac/"> Andjela Radmilac </a><div class="post-meta-card__title editorial-credits__title"> <span>Senior Analyst</span> <span class="title-separator" aria-hidden="true">•</span> 