 decoding="async"
 loading="lazy"
 > </picture></figure><div class="content list-post-grid__content"><div class="eyebrow"> <span>Governance</span></div><h3>Cardano’s wallet hack exposed the user layer holding its on-chain government together</h3><p class="excerpt">Cardano’s governance model depends on ordinary ADA holders participating, and the SecondFi exploit shows how much that model depends on secure wallet UX.</p><div class="post-meta"> <span class="read"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i>3 days ago</span></div></div> </a></article></div><div class="list-post list-post-grid"><article id="post-543906" class="list-post-grid__card"> <a class="list-post-grid__link" href="https://cryptoslate.com/cardano-advances-major-scaling-overhaul-as-security-breach-and-ada-token-slump-hits-market-conviction/" title="Cardano’s scaling overhaul hit by a user confidence gap widened by ADA’s slump and wallet exploit"><figure class="cover list-post-grid__cover"> <picture> <source media="(max-width: 767px)" data-srcset="https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/cardano-security-breach-768x432.jpg"> <noscript><img
