 ></noscript><img class="lazyload"  src='data:image/svg+xml,%3Csvg%20xmlns=%22http://www.w3.org/2000/svg%22%20viewBox=%220%200%20210%20140%22%3E%3C/svg%3E' data-src="https://cryptoslate.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/06/hoskinson-cardano-control-768x432.jpg"
 alt="Cardano founder Charles Hoskinson takes &#8220;a break&#8221; &#8211; exposing who really controls ADA&#8217;s next move"
 decoding="async"
 loading="lazy"
 > </picture></figure><div class="content list-post-grid__content"><div class="eyebrow"> <span>Bear Market</span></div><h3>Cardano founder Charles Hoskinson takes &#8220;a break&#8221; &#8211; exposing who really controls ADA&#8217;s next move</h3><p class="excerpt">Hoskinson&#039;s public pause points to a governance tradeoff for ADA holders, DReps, and builders rather than an exit from Cardano.</p><div class="post-meta"> <span class="read"><i class="fa-regular fa-clock"></i>1 month ago</span></div></div> </a></article></div></div></div></div><div
